@svc = http://localhost:5400

### WSDL (sözleşme) — keşfedilebilirlik
GET {{svc}}/CreditScoringService.svc?wsdl

### WSDL'in import ettiği XSD şeması (veri sözleşmeleri)
GET {{svc}}/CreditScoringService.svc?xsd=xsd0

### Customer servisinin WSDL'i
GET {{svc}}/CustomerService.svc?wsdl

### Ham SOAP 1.1 isteği: GetScore
POST {{svc}}/CreditScoringService.svc
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "http://bank.example.com/credit/2026/01/ICreditScoringService/GetScore"

<s:Envelope xmlns:s="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <s:Body>
    <GetScore xmlns="http://bank.example.com/credit/2026/01">
      <request>
        <NationalId>12345678901</NationalId>
        <MonthlyIncome>45000</MonthlyIncome>
      </request>
    </GetScore>
  </s:Body>
</s:Envelope>

### Ham SOAP: GetCustomer
POST {{svc}}/CustomerService.svc
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "http://bank.example.com/customer/2026/01/ICustomerService/GetCustomer"

<s:Envelope xmlns:s="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <s:Body>
    <GetCustomer xmlns="http://bank.example.com/customer/2026/01">
      <request>
        <CustomerId>aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa</CustomerId>
      </request>
    </GetCustomer>
  </s:Body>
</s:Envelope>

### SOAP Fault örneği: geçersiz TC kimlik no → HTTP 500 + <s:Fault><detail><ServiceFault>
POST {{svc}}/CreditScoringService.svc
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "http://bank.example.com/credit/2026/01/ICreditScoringService/GetScore"

<s:Envelope xmlns:s="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <s:Body>
    <GetScore xmlns="http://bank.example.com/credit/2026/01">
      <request><NationalId>123</NationalId><MonthlyIncome>45000</MonthlyIncome></request>
    </GetScore>
  </s:Body>
</s:Envelope>
